{"step_index":161,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:28:12Z","thinking":"Initial focus is on expanding the speedrun mission flowcharts. The plan is to create a detailed version of the existing flowchart, incorporating missing elements from Chapter 1. Specifically, the \"DON GONE\" mission completion must include Cal's call for \"RECALIBRATION\" (Cal Intervention) and Mattia's text related to \"TOURIST TRAP\".\n\n\nExpanding the speedrun flowchart with Chapter 1's \"POINT OF NO RETURN\" requires including key events like the \"HOME SWEET HOME\" ambush and the \"DISCHARGE TIME\" climax leading to Chapter 2. Speedrun callouts and skips are incorporated: specific mission parallelization (\"Unwanted Attention\" and \"Gear Up\"), and mandatory skips to streamline early game.\n\nFurther outlining the macro-pipeline: Fast-tracking specific missions in Chapter 2, optimizing Chapter 3's bank heist for a specific take, and strategically spending the funds in Chapter 4 for speedrunning. Chapter 5 focuses on quick decision-making for the fastest any% ending.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Python script to generate the fully expanded Speedrun Flowchart for Chapter 1 and the Master Campaign Speedrun Flowchart matching the GTAVI_MISSION_FLOW1.jpg layout and adding all missing story missions, speedrun skips, and time-saving routing.","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport matplotlib.patches as patches\nimport os\nimport shutil\n\nWORKSPACE_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\"\nARTIFACT_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\.gemini\\antigravity-cli\\brain\\96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c\"\n\nBG_COLOR = \"#33363b\"       # Matches GTAVI_MISSION_FLOW1.jpg dark-slate gray\n\ndef draw_mission(ax, x, y, w, h, title, subtitle=\"\", is_climax=False, is_gate=False, font_size=8.5):\n    bg = \"#fef08a\" if not is_climax else \"#ffedd5\"\n    border = \"#ca8a04\" if not is_climax else \"#ea580c\"\n    lw = 2.0 if (is_climax or is_gate) else 1.2\n    \n    rect = patches.Rectangle((x, y), w, h, linewidth=lw, edgecolor=border, facecolor=bg, zorder=3)\n    ax.add_patch(rect)\n    \n    ty = y + h/2 + 0.12 if subtitle else y + h/2\n    ax.text(x + w/2, ty, title, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#1c1917\", zorder=4)\n    if subtitle:\n        ax.text(x + w/2, y + 0.18, subtitle, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size-1.8, color=\"#44403c\", zorder=4)\n\ndef draw_callout(ax, x, y, w, h, text, icon_type=\"text\", font_size=7.2):\n    rect = patches.Rectangle((x, y), w, h, linewidth=1.0, edgecolor=\"#71717a\", facecolor=\"#ffffff\", zorder=3)\n    ax.add_patch(rect)\n    \n    prefix = \"\"\n    if icon_type == \"phone\":\n        prefix = \"☎ \"\n    elif icon_type == \"text\":\n        prefix = \"✉ \"\n    elif icon_type == \"mailbox\":\n        prefix = \"📭 \"\n    elif icon_type == \"cash\":\n        prefix = \"💰 \"\n        \n    ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2, prefix + text, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\" if icon_type==\"phone\" else \"normal\", color=\"#09090b\", zorder=4)\n\ndef draw_heart(ax, x, y, w, h, text, skip_label=\"[ANY% SKIP]\", font_size=7.0):\n    rect = patches.Rectangle((x, y), w, h, linewidth=1.2, edgecolor=\"#f43f5e\", facecolor=\"#ffe4e6\", zorder=3)\n    ax.add_patch(rect)\n    t = \"♥ \" + text\n    if skip_label:\n        t += \"\\n\" + skip_label\n    ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2, t, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#9f1239\", zorder=4)\n\ndef draw_side(ax, x, y, w, h, text, font_size=7.0):\n    rect = patches.Rectangle((x, y), w, h, linewidth=1.2, edgecolor=\"#a855f7\", facecolor=\"#f3e8ff\", zorder=3)\n    ax.add_patch(rect)\n    t = text + \"\\n[OPTIONAL / SKIP]\"\n    ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2, t, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, color=\"#581c87\", zorder=4)\n\ndef draw_diamond(ax, cx, cy, rx, ry, text, font_size=6.8):\n    pts = [[cx, cy + ry], [cx + rx, cy], [cx, cy - ry], [cx - rx, cy]]\n    poly = patches.Polygon(pts, closed=True, linewidth=1.4, edgecolor=\"#cbd5e1\", facecolor=\"#ffffff\", zorder=3)\n    ax.add_patch(poly)\n    ax.text(cx, cy, text, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#0f172a\", zorder=4)\n\ndef draw_speedrun_badge(ax, x, y, w, h, title, note, font_size=6.8):\n    rect = patches.Rectangle((x, y), w, h, linewidth=1.4, edgecolor=\"#10b981\", facecolor=\"#064e3b\", zorder=3)\n    ax.add_patch(rect)\n    ax.text(x + w/2, y + h - 0.22, \"⚡ \" + title, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size+0.6, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#34d399\", zorder=4)\n    ax.text(x + w/2, y + h/2 - 0.1, note, ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=font_size, color=\"#ecfdf5\", zorder=4)\n\ndef draw_arrow(ax, p1, p2, color=\"#ffffff\", lw=1.2, rad=0.0):\n    conn = f\"arc3,rad={rad}\" if rad != 0 else \"arc3,rad=0\"\n    ax.annotate(\n        \"\",\n        xy=p2, xytext=p1,\n        arrowprops=dict(\n            arrowstyle=\"->,head_width=0.28,head_length=0.38\",\n            color=color,\n            lw=lw,\n            shrinkA=3,\n            shrinkB=3,\n            connectionstyle=conn\n        ),\n        zorder=2\n    )\n\n# =========================================================================\n# 1. RENDER COMPLETE CHAPTER 1 IN GTAVI_MISSION_FLOW1.JPG STYLE + MISSING\n# =========================================================================\ndef render_speedrun_chapter_1():\n    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(26, 32), dpi=200)\n    fig.patch.set_facecolor(BG_COLOR)\n    ax.set_facecolor(BG_COLOR)\n    ax.set_xlim(0, 26)\n    ax.set_ylim(0, 32)\n    ax.axis(\"off\")\n    \n    # Title Banner\n    ax.text(13, 31.4, \"GRAND THEFT AUTO VI — CHAPTER 1 SPEEDRUN MISSION FLOW\", ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=18, fontweight=\"bold\", color=\"#ffffff\")\n    ax.text(13, 30.9, \"Micro-Triggers, Phone Calls, Mailboxes, Parallel Branch Optimization & The Missing Climax (Missions 1 - 22)\", ha=\"center\", va=\"center\", fontsize=10.5, color=\"#fde047\")\n    \n    # Top: PROLOGUE -> GONE FISHING\n    mw, mh = 3.6, 0.95\n    center_x = 11.2\n    \n    draw_mission(ax, center_x, 29.5, mw, mh, \"PROLOGUE\", \"Lucia Prison Counselor Interview\")\n    draw_mission(ax, center_x, 28.0, mw, mh, \"GONE FISHING\", \"Jason & Donnie Boat Drop\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (center_x + mw/2, 29.5), (center_x + mw/2, 28.95))\n    \n    # Donnie Text Mailbox\n    draw_callout(ax, center_x + mw + 0.4, 28.05, 3.4, 0.75, \"DONNIE TEXT\\n($140 IN MAILBOX)\", \"mailbox\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (center_x + mw, 28.45), (center_x + mw + 0.4, 28.45))\n    \n    # Split bar below Gone Fishing\n    split_y = 27.2\n    ax.plot([3.5, 13.0, 20.5], [split_y, split_y, split_y], color=\"#ffffff\", lw=1.5, zorder=2)\n    draw_arrow(ax, (center_x + mw/2, 28.0), (center_x + mw/2, split_y))\n    \n    # -------------------------------------------------------------\n    # BRANCH 1: UNWANTED ATTENTION & PIPEWORK (Left Side: x = 1.8)\n    # -------------------------------------------------------------\n    b1_x = 1.8\n    draw_arrow(ax, (3.5, split_y), (b1_x + mw/2, 26.2))\n    draw_mission(ax, b1_x, 25.2, mw, mh, \"UNWANTED ATTENTION\", \"Cal & Jason Drive to Hamlet\")\n    \n    draw_callout(ax, b1_x, 24.1, mw, 0.75, \"CAL TEXT\\n($200 IN MAILBOX)\", \"mailbox\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b1_x + mw/2, 25.2), (b1_x + mw/2, 24.85))\n    \n    draw_callout(ax, b1_x, 23.0, mw, 0.65, \"BRIAN CALL\", \"phone\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b1_x + mw/2, 24.1), (b1_x + mw/2, 23.65))\n    \n    draw_mission(ax, b1_x, 21.7, mw, mh, \"PIPEWORK\", \"Marina Maintenance Jobs\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b1_x + mw/2, 23.0), (b1_x + mw/2, 22.65))\n    \n    draw_callout(ax, b1_x, 20.6, mw, 0.65, \"BRIAN TEXT\", \"text\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b1_x + mw/2, 21.7), (b1_x + mw/2, 21.25))\n    \n    draw_callout(ax, b1_x + mw + 0.3, 21.7, 3.2, 0.8, \"CHUCK'S GUN SHOP TEXT\\n(Long Cooldown Trigger)\", \"text\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b1_x + mw, 22.15), (b1_x + mw + 0.3, 22.15))\n    \n    # Speedrun routing tip for Branch 1\n    draw_speedrun_badge(ax, b1_x - 0.2, 18.8, mw + 0.4, 1.4, \"PARALLEL DOWNTIME ROUTING\", \"Clear Unwanted Attention & Pipework\\nduring Feng Shui's 24h wait!\\nGrab $200 mailbox immediately.\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b1_x + mw/2, 20.6), (b1_x + mw/2, 20.2))\n    \n    # -------------------------------------------------------------\n    # BRANCH 2: GEAR UP & JUST A SCRATCH (Middle-Left: x = 6.8)\n    # -------------------------------------------------------------\n    b2_x = 6.8\n    draw_arrow(ax, (8.6, split_y), (b2_x + mw/2, 26.2))\n    draw_mission(ax, b2_x, 25.2, mw, mh, \"GEAR UP\", \"Pick up Longarm for Brian\")\n    \n    draw_callout(ax, b2_x, 24.0, mw, 0.75, \"POST-MISSION FORCED CALL\\nFROM DONNIE\", \"phone\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b2_x + mw/2, 25.2), (b2_x + mw/2, 24.75))\n    \n    draw_callout(ax, b2_x, 22.9, mw, 0.65, \"JOEY TEXT\", \"text\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b2_x + mw/2, 24.0), (b2_x + mw/2, 23.55))\n    \n    draw_heart(ax, b2_x, 21.6, mw, mh, \"JUST A SCRATCH\\n(Ganado Repair & Respray)\", skip_label=\"[MANDATORY STORY GATE!]\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b2_x + mw/2, 22.9), (b2_x + mw/2, 22.6))\n    \n    draw_speedrun_badge(ax, b2_x - 0.2, 19.5, mw + 0.4, 1.5, \"MANDATORY GATE WARNING\", \"Just a Scratch CANNOT be skipped!\\nIf ignored, Joey calls repeatedly and\\nhalts progression at Day Release.\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b2_x + mw/2, 21.6), (b2_x + mw/2, 21.0))\n    \n    # -------------------------------------------------------------\n    # BRANCH 3: LAB FEES -> HEY ARNOLD! -> FENG SHUI -> COMING HOME\n    # -------------------------------------------------------------\n    b3_x = 12.0\n    draw_arrow(ax, (13.0, split_y), (b3_x + mw/2, 26.2))\n    draw_mission(ax, b3_x, 25.2, mw, mh, \"LAB FEES\", \"Brian's Rent Collection\")\n    \n    # Side task: Drug/diamond drop off\n    draw_side(ax, b3_x + mw + 0.4, 25.25, 3.4, 0.85, \"GRAB ANY DRUG, CASH\\nOR DIAMOND ON MAP\\n(Unlocks Brian's Drop Off)\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b3_x + mw, 25.65), (b3_x + mw + 0.4, 25.65))\n    \n    draw_callout(ax, b3_x, 24.0, mw, 0.65, \"BRIAN'S CALL\", \"phone\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b3_x + mw/2, 25.2), (b3_x + mw/2, 24.65))\n    \n    draw_mission(ax, b3_x, 22.7, mw, mh, \"HEY ARNOLD!\", \"Track Down Cargo Broker\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b3_x + mw/2, 24.0), (b3_x + mw/2, 23.65))\n    \n    # Offshoots from Hey Arnold\n    draw_mission(ax, b3_x - 3.2, 21.3, 2.9, 0.85, \"ISLAND DREAMS\", \"Keys Diving\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b3_x, 23.0), (b3_x - 1.75, 22.15))\n    draw_callout(ax, b3_x - 3.2, 20.1, 2.9, 0.7, \"KENTON CALL\\n(Treasure Search)\", \"phone\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b3_x - 1.75, 21.3), (b3_x - 1.75, 20.8))\n    \n    draw_callout(ax, b3_x + 0.1, 21.4, 2.5, 0.65, \"CAL'S TEXT\", \"text\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b3_x + mw/2, 22.7), (b3_x + 1.35, 22.05))\n    \n    draw_callout(ax, b3_x + 2.8, 21.4, 2.8, 0.65, \"BRIAN'S TEXT\\n($600 MAILBOX)\", \"mailbox\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b3_x + mw, 22.9), (b3_x + 4.2, 22.05))\n    \n    draw_side(ax, b3_x + 5.8, 21.3, 2.9, 0.85, \"DONNIE TEXT\\nKingfishers Robbery\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b3_x + mw, 23.1), (b3_x + 7.25, 22.15))\n    \n    # FENG SHUI\n    draw_mission(ax, b3_x, 19.8, mw, mh, \"FENG SHUI\", \"Move Furniture for Brian\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b3_x + mw/2, 21.4), (b3_x + mw/2, 20.75))\n    \n    # 24H Cooldown Note\n    draw_callout(ax, b3_x, 18.6, mw, 0.75, \"24 IN-GAME HOURS LATER\\n→ LUCIA CALL\", \"phone\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (b3_x + mw/2, 19.8), (b3_x + mw/2, 19.35))\n    \n    # 4 Heart Activities (ALL ANY% SKIPS!)\n    h_y = 18.6\n    draw_heart(ax, b3_x + 4.0, h_y, 2.4, 0.75, \"GET HAIRCUT\")\n    draw_heart(ax, b3_x + 6.6, h_y, 2.4, 0.75, \"BUY NECKLACE\")\n    draw_heart(ax, b3_x + 9.2, h_y, 2